ers/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":7,"created_at":"2025-09-18T13:13:40Z","updated_at":"2026-01-12T09:30:16Z","closed_at":"2025-10-22T00:16:40Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.5.1 Source build with minor changes but none related to anything graphical.\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11, RTX 3080, 64Gb DDR5 RAM, i9-13900K, Compatibility renderer, OBS 30.2.3\n\n### Issue description\n\nI wanted to record a quick clip in OBS and saw that the Game Capture source is flipped vertically, this wasn't the case in 4.3 (I skipped 4.4) and I believe this may have to do with the updates to the GameView that went into 4.5. It's not a critical issue as you can flip the video in OBS but by default you'd expect it to be right side up of-course.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nRun any project in Godot in the separate window for the gameview.\nIn OBS, setup a Game Capture source pointing to the Specific Window and select the Godot Editor window (there's multiple for me, pick any of them until you get the game capture itself).\nObserve that the video is flipped vertically (can be adjusted in OBS but should be right side up by default)\n\n<img width=\"1084\" height=\"917\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a5c4dafe-6f24-4622-ace1-3f5997207c03\" />\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nNot needed, any project will do.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110657/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110657/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}